    "quotes": [
      {
        "speaker": "Mike Logue",
        "quote": "When customers put their own money into your business, it tells you something no pitch deck can. AI is changing how people discover brands faster than any shift I’ve seen in marketing, and most teams are still flying blind. We’ve spent a year learning what actually moves the needle. Now it’s time to put that into the hands of every marketing team that needs it.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-e4d165398d19a4da",
            "quote": "When customers put their own money into your business, it tells you something no pitch deck can. AI is changing how people discover brands faster than any shift I’ve seen in marketing, and most teams are still flying blind. We’ve spent a year learning what actually moves the needle. Now it’s time to put that into the hands of every marketing team that needs it.",
            "source_content_hash": "5323335804195fbc7493a6707f9c33f7aa1d6261d115b65b154e1cbdef1d820e",
            "quote_hash": "ebaa9206e07cc05a5e7c60c8351c42c910fdd59454f237e1eb12831399266c5f"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Andy Francos",
        "quote": "I’ve spent my career in organic search, and I’ve never seen the ground move this quickly. Much of what worked in SEO still matters, but AI engines weigh sources, context and credibility in new ways. Brands that assume their old playbook will carry over are already losing ground. Over the past year we’ve built a clear, evidence-based view of what drives visibility in AI Search. Now we’re putting that expertise into agents, so every team can apply it, not just the ones that can afford a specialist.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          {
            "source_id": "FISRC-e4d165398d19a4da",
            "quote": "I’ve spent my career in organic search, and I’ve never seen the ground move this quickly. Much of what worked in SEO still matters, but AI engines weigh sources, context and credibility in new ways. Brands that assume their old playbook will carry over are already losing ground. Over the past year we’ve built a clear, evidence-based view of what drives visibility in AI Search. Now we’re putting that expertise into agents, so every team can apply it, not just the ones that can afford a specialist.",
